# a format 28 project, from before the FX tracks were slots of the one effects list (format 29: an FX track's pick,
# four knobs, PING WIDTH, WOBBLE, SMEAR and level become its slot 1: project.c fx_old): saved by that build, for the
# migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). FX I a delay with every value off its default (time 70, fine 80,
# repeats 90, tone 30, width 50, wobble 40, smear 20, level 90; its filter and its feed into FX II), FX II the plate
# (size 90, motion 30, tone 50, damp 100, level 80). (An FX track has no lanes: no lock to carry.)
# Run by a format 28 build (5ff9c50): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v28.xy
wait 300
bpm 115
param 11 engine 1
param 11 e1 70
param 11 e2 80
param 11 e3 90
param 11 e4 30
param 11 x1 50
param 11 x2 40
param 11 x3 20
param 11 level 90
param 11 fenv 30
param 11 cut 110
param 11 send2 45
param 12 engine 4
param 12 e1 90
param 12 e2 30
param 12 e3 50
param 12 e4 100
param 12 level 80
wait 40
projsave 1 v28_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v28.bin
